privacy.processors:
Your data is neither sold nor shared. It is processed on our behalf, under contract, by:

– Vercel Inc. (United States) — site hosting and audience measurement;
– Supabase Inc. — database and administrator accounts, data hosted in London (United Kingdom);
– Resend Inc. (United States) — email delivery: newsletter, subscription confirmation, contact form messages.

Each is bound by a data processing agreement compliant with Article 28 of the GDPR.

privacy.cookies:
The site only sets technical cookies, exempt from consent:

– i18n_redirected: the chosen language (one year);
– ov_cookie_consent: remembers that you have read the cookie notice (one year);
– for signed-in administrators only, the Supabase session cookies.

No advertising or tracking cookie is used.
